{"audio": "2timothy-02.opus", "voice": "Davis", "duration_ms": 176133, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 1733, "text": "2 Timothy, Chapter Two."}, {"start_ms": 1733, "end_ms": 5467, "text": "Thou therefore, my son, be strong in the grace that is in Christ Jesus."}, {"start_ms": 5467, "end_ms": 14667, "text": "And the things that thou hast heard of me among many witnesses, the same commit thou to faithful men, who shall be able to teach others also."}, {"start_ms": 14667, "end_ms": 18933, "text": "Thou therefore endure hardness, as a good soldier of Jesus Christ."}, {"start_ms": 18933, "end_ms": 26133, "text": "No man that warreth entangleth himself with the affairs of this life; that he may please him who hath chosen him to be a soldier."}, {"start_ms": 26133, "end_ms": 32400, "text": "And if a man also strive for masteries, yet is he not crowned, except he strive lawfully."}, {"start_ms": 32400, "end_ms": 36800, "text": "The husbandman that laboureth must be first partaker of the fruits."}, {"start_ms": 36800, "end_ms": 42000, "text": "Consider what I say; and the Lord give thee understanding in all things."}, {"start_ms": 42000, "end_ms": 52533, "text": "Remember that Jesus Christ of the seed of David was raised from the dead according to my gospel: Wherein I suffer trouble, as an evil doer, even unto bonds; but the word of God is not bound."}, {"start_ms": 52533, "end_ms": 60800, "text": "Therefore I endure all things for the elect's sakes, that they may also obtain the salvation which is in Christ Jesus with eternal glory."}, {"start_ms": 60800, "end_ms": 76400, "text": "It is a faithful saying: For if we be dead with him, we shall also live with him: If we suffer, we shall also reign with him: if we deny him, he also will deny us: If we believe not, yet he abideth faithful: he cannot deny himself."}, {"start_ms": 76400, "end_ms": 85867, "text": "Of these things put them in remembrance, charging them before the Lord that they strive not about words to no profit, but to the subverting of the hearers."}, {"start_ms": 85867, "end_ms": 92533, "text": "Study to shew thyself approved unto God, a workman that needeth not to be ashamed, rightly dividing the word of truth."}, {"start_ms": 92533, "end_ms": 98133, "text": "But shun profane and vain babblings: for they will increase unto more ungodliness."}, {"start_ms": 98133, "end_ms": 111067, "text": "And their word will eat as doth a canker: of whom is Hymenaeus and Philetus; Who concerning the truth have erred, saying that the resurrection is past already; and overthrow the faith of some."}, {"start_ms": 111067, "end_ms": 117867, "text": "Nevertheless the foundation of God standeth sure, having this seal, The Lord knoweth them that are his."}, {"start_ms": 117867, "end_ms": 122400, "text": "And, Let every one that nameth the name of Christ depart from iniquity."}, {"start_ms": 122400, "end_ms": 131333, "text": "But in a great house there are not only vessels of gold and of silver, but also of wood and of earth; and some to honour, and some to dishonour."}, {"start_ms": 131333, "end_ms": 140133, "text": "If a man therefore purge himself from these, he shall be a vessel unto honour, sanctified, and meet for the master's use, and prepared unto every good work."}, {"start_ms": 140133, "end_ms": 149467, "text": "Flee also youthful lusts: but follow righteousness, faith, charity, peace, with them that call on the Lord out of a pure heart."}, {"start_ms": 149467, "end_ms": 155200, "text": "But foolish and unlearned questions avoid, knowing that they do gender strifes."}, {"start_ms": 155200, "end_ms": 173333, "text": "And the servant of the Lord must not strive; but be gentle unto all men, apt to teach, patient, In meekness instructing those that oppose themselves; if God peradventure will give them repentance to the acknowledging of the truth; And that they may recover themselves out of the snare of the devil,"}, {"start_ms": 173333, "end_ms": 176133, "text": "who are taken captive by him at his will."}], "words": [{"t": "2", "s": 0, "e": 524, "si": 0}, {"t": "Timothy,", "s": 524, "e": 806, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 1048, "e": 1350, "si": 0}, {"t": "Two.", "s": 1411, "e": 1592, "si": 0}, {"t": "Thou", "s": 1974, "e": 2114, "si": 1}, {"t": "therefore,", "s": 2175, "e": 2656, "si": 1}, {"t": "my", "s": 2697, "e": 2837, "si": 1}, {"t": "son,", "s": 2938, "e": 3178, "si": 1}, {"t": "be", "s": 3259, "e": 3319, "si": 1}, {"t": "strong", "s": 3399, "e": 3700, "si": 1}, {"t": "in", "s": 3741, "e": 3781, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 3801, "e": 3881, "si": 1}, {"t": "grace", "s": 3921, "e": 4222, "si": 1}, {"t": "that", "s": 4242, "e": 4363, "si": 1}, {"t": "is", "s": 4403, "e": 4483, "si": 1}, {"t": "in", "s": 4523, "e": 4604, "si": 1}, {"t": "Christ", "s": 4644, "e": 4945, "si": 1}, {"t": "Jesus.", "s": 4985, "e": 5407, "si": 1}, {"t": "And", "s": 6189, "e": 6309, "si": 2}, {"t": "the", "s": 6329, "e": 6409, "si": 2}, {"t": "things", "s": 6489, "e": 6810, "si": 2}, {"t": "that", "s": 6850, "e": 6970, "si": 2}, {"t": "thou", "s": 7010, "e": 7171, "si": 2}, {"t": "hast", "s": 7231, "e": 7411, "si": 2}, {"t": "heard", "s": 7451, "e": 7672, "si": 2}, {"t": "of", "s": 7712, "e": 7772, "si": 2}, {"t": "me", "s": 7852, "e": 7912, "si": 2}, {"t": "among", "s": 8133, "e": 8413, "si": 2}, {"t": "many", "s": 8514, "e": 8714, "si": 2}, {"t": "witnesses,", "s": 8814, "e": 9396, "si": 2}, {"t": "the", "s": 9897, "e": 9977, "si": 2}, {"t": "same", "s": 10077, "e": 10318, "si": 2}, {"t": "commit", "s": 10378, "e": 10678, "si": 2}, {"t": "thou", "s": 10779, "e": 10939, "si": 2}, {"t": "to", "s": 11019, "e": 11099, "si": 2}, {"t": "faithful", "s": 11199, "e": 11620, "si": 2}, {"t": "men,", "s": 11660, "e": 11881, "si": 2}, {"t": "who", "s": 12482, "e": 12562, "si": 2}, {"t": "shall", "s": 12643, "e": 12843, "si": 2}, {"t": "be", "s": 12883, "e": 12943, "si": 2}, {"t": "able", "s": 13064, "e": 13284, "si": 2}, {"t": "to", "s": 13304, "e": 13384, "si": 2}, {"t": 